{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/j6tovaho","slide":1,"text":"What the task is","textPreview":"What the task is","textChars":16,"textLines":1,"bbox":[872,242,286,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ulwval87","slide":1,"text":"A repeated, abstract, slot-machine-like allocation problem with three channels: alpha, beta, and gamma.","textPreview":"A repeated, abstract, slot-machine-like allocation problem with three channels: alpha, beta, and gamma.","textChars":103,"textLines":1,"bbox":[872,274,286,52]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/ed8v6psf","slide":1,"bbox":[850,362,330,116]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/7y1kre1w","slide":1,"bbox":[850,362,5,116]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wjudg7ad","slide":1,"text":"Why history matters","textPreview":"Why history matters","textChars":19,"textLines":1,"bbox":[872,378,286,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/p4r65wju","slide":1,"text":"Payoffs are noisy but structured: short trends, state shifts, mean reversion, and random shocks all matter.","textPreview":"Payoffs are noisy but structured: short trends, state shifts, mean reversion, and random shocks all matter.","textChars":107,"textLines":1,"bbox":[872,410,286,52]}
