{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/pwb2hwfy","slide":1,"text":"The interface stays the same. Treatments change when AI errors cluster and whether performance later recovers.","textPreview":"The interface stays the same. Treatments change when AI errors cluster and whether performance later recovers.","textChars":110,"textLines":1,"bbox":[872,546,286,52]}
